ple","authorIdentity":"unknown","examProvenance":"unverified-unless-separately-established"},"reviewVerified":false}],"assessmentFingerprint":"bb9663b7","semanticRuntimeSignature":"d51ccaa055d9ca8533173da0f2ec1ca1d600a964561034b253369f387d94f991"},{"id":"notes-q-app-ve01-000190","revision":1,"status":"review","subjectId":"verbal","categoryId":"detail","exerciseKinds":["application"],"sourceKind":"legacy-unverified","familyId":"notes-origin-notes-source-example-000190","exposureGroupId":"notes-exposure-notes-source-example-000190","answerMode":"single-choice","origin":{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"detail-judgement","tabId":"example","sourceExampleRecordId":"notes-source-example-000190","expectedBlockSha256":"08d3331619457e073253e26ff385edbc9d95a547f3664d2f6f8f8319a6279f6a"},"originAdaptation":{"kind":"neutral-display-completion","instruction":"根据这段文字，选择对坐底仿生水沙观测系统表述正确的一项。","reason":"现有笔记块保留题干、四个选项、答案，原解析措辞已按独立复核纠正；公开同题题面核对出原任务方向。仅补中性作答说明，不认证官方题源。"},"assessment":{"taskType":"complete-application","knowledgeAtomIds":[],"requiresCalculation":false},"primaryTargetIds":["notes-target-app-ve01-000190"],"supportingTargetIds":[],"refs":[{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"detail-judgement","tabId":"knowledge","expectedSha256":"3ff8341a65887a912c0307ede567765eb39ad120bc3d54b5d2bd867dfb77c28c","fingerprint":"14aa271b"},{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"detail-judgement","tabId":"example","expectedSha256":"3d570c74707b05378e0784b11127cefc1d11a2936bfaa2b267106470f26354c2","fingerprint":"df717d"}],"distractorReasons":{"A":"原文只说监测进入新阶段，没有说明这是我国第一套系统。","B":"原文没有说明灾害预警用途。","C":"原文说系统匍匐在急流水底，不是自行漂浮，也未说覆盖全流域。"},"originTask":{"verified":true,"statement":"对于山区河流开发保护研究来说，传统采沙方法依靠人力取水，采样时间间隔长，获取数据效率低。坐底仿生水沙观测系统的投放，标志着我国山区河流水沙监测进入了高时间分辨率全过程监测的新阶段。所谓仿生，就是指系统形状像一条鱼，能匍匐在水流很急的水底，这种系统和技术可以搭载水温、浊度及压力传感器等多种观测设备，以此实现对河流水文特征及动力条件的分钟级连续观测。目前，该技术已经应用于对青藏高原河流沉积物来源、组成及从搬运动力过程开展超高时间分辨率定量化研究中。\n根据这段文字，坐底仿生水沙观测系统：","evidence":"公开同题题面与当前题干、选项和答案相符；仅恢复任务方向，考试年份与官方真题身份未认证。"},"reviewVerified":false,"resourceType":"question","prompt":"根据这段文字，选择对坐底仿生水沙观测系统表述正确的一项。\n对于山区河流开发保护研究来说，传统采沙方法依靠人力取水，采样时间间隔长，获取数据效率低。坐底仿生水沙观测系统的投放，标志着我国山区河流水沙监测进入了高时间分辨率全过程监测的新阶段。所谓仿生，就是指系统形状像一条鱼，能匍匐在水流很急的水底，这种系统和技术可以搭载水温、浊度及压力传感器等多种观测设备，以此实现对河流水文特征及动力条件的分钟级连续观测。目前，该技术已经应用于对青藏高原河流沉积物来源、组成及从搬运动力过程开展超高时间分辨率定量化研究中。","options":[{"key":"A","text":"是我国第一套监测山区河流水沙的系统"},{"key":"B","text":"探测结果可以为灾害预警提供数据支撑"},{"key":"C","text":"可以自行漂浮在水中对全流域进行监测"},{"key":"D","text":"实现了对河流水沙沉积过程的连续监测"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"A 原文只说监测进入新阶段，没有说明这是我国第一套系统。B 原文没有提到灾害预警。C 与“匍匐在水流很急的水底”相反，且原文没有说可自行漂浮或监测全流域。D 的“连续监测”对应全过程、分钟级连续观测及水沙沉积物研究，正确。","originalExampleFingerprint":"c88cb728","declaredOriginalSource":"2022国考","answerSourceKeys":["[\"verbal\",\"detail-judgement\",\"example\"]"],"semanticAdmission":{"questionBinding":{"questionId":"notes-q-app-ve01-000190","questionRevision":1,"effectiveContentDigest":"bccb168725d5ca811ff26bc37838090fda14b42bdacb7298d9c72ac4a8c82fd9"},"resolvedDependencyManifest":{"primaryTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-app-ve01-000190","revision":1,"sha256":"2ed79ed755558ea73b729b1687764d0ca13a27e9b96bb0b0bc74bcaa8f321af2"}],"supportingTargets":[],"knowledgeAtoms":[],"comparisonGroups":[],"sourceBindings":[{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"detail-judgement","tabId":"example","revision":null,"sha256":"3d570c74707b05378e0784b11127cefc1d11a2936bfaa2b267106470f26354c2"},{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"detail-judgement","tabId":"knowledge","revision":null,"sha256":"3ff8341a65887a912c0307ede567765eb39ad120bc3d54b5d2bd867dfb77c28c"}],"sourceAnchors":[],"originalExample":{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"detail-judgement","tabId":"example","expectedBlockSha256":"08d3331619457e073253e26ff385edbc9d95a547f3664d2f6f8f8319a6279f6a","revision":null},"materialGroup":null,"images":[],"sharedSourceBindings":[]},"dependencyDigest":"e936267c4759556548c53b1e3ab41fcf6fe7b1507252ed6d4ecbebd270b6d1d7","ruleVersion":"exam-goal-v4","ruleDigest":"cde4b0cf5c8f1542a5a662cc642037c39b9968aba1618b319d56fd8b62cb8033","receiptId":"app-ve01