78"},{"id":"notes-q-app-ve01-000191","revision":2,"status":"review","subjectId":"verbal","categoryId":"detail","exerciseKinds":["application"],"sourceKind":"legacy-unverified","familyId":"notes-origin-notes-source-example-000191","exposureGroupId":"notes-exposure-notes-source-example-000191","answerMode":"single-choice","origin":{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"detail-judgement","tabId":"example","sourceExampleRecordId":"notes-source-example-000191","expectedBlockSha256":"fdf8e39922cfa60192f6ffc8c4ac9e9f4568bc3484760a2bfe10a9580a25dee8"},"originAdaptation":{"kind":"neutral-display-completion","instruction":"根据这段文字，选择说法正确的一项。","reason":"现有笔记块保留题干、四个选项、答案和解析，但遗漏题目问法；公开同题题面核对出原任务方向。仅补中性作答说明，不改变现有题目内容或宣称官方题源。"},"assessment":{"taskType":"complete-application","knowledgeAtomIds":[],"requiresCalculation":false},"primaryTargetIds":["notes-target-app-ve01-000191"],"supportingTargetIds":[],"refs":[{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"detail-judgement","tabId":"knowledge","expectedSha256":"3ff8341a65887a912c0307ede567765eb39ad120bc3d54b5d2bd867dfb77c28c","fingerprint":"14aa271b"},{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"detail-judgement","tabId":"example","expectedSha256":"3d570c74707b05378e0784b11127cefc1d11a2936bfaa2b267106470f26354c2","fingerprint":"df717d"}],"distractorReasons":{"B":"文段没有比较小鼠与人类的体温控制机制。","C":"“只能依靠”过于绝对，文段还提到白色脂肪棕色化等过程。","D":"文段只说明缺失菌群会减弱UCP-1增加，未给出数量成正比关系。"},"originTask":{"verified":true,"statement":"棕色脂肪组织是一种功能特化为产热的组织，低温时动物通过激活棕色脂肪组织和促进白色脂肪棕色化的方式增加产热，以维持体温。团队科研人员利用不同的抗生素配方处理小鼠以清除小鼠的肠道菌群，发现缺失肠道菌群的小鼠体温调控机制受到破坏，研究发现肠道菌群的缺失减弱了棕色脂肪组织中UCP-1蛋白表达量的增加，降低了白色脂肪组织的棕色化水平。科研人员认为，产生这种作用的原因可能是在寒冷条件下，肠道菌群被破坏后，动物不能消化足够数量的食物，以满足寒冷条件下的热量需求。\n根据这段文字，下列说法正确的是：","evidence":"公开同题题面与现有题干、选项和答案相符；仅恢复作答方向，考试年份与官方真题身份未认证。"},"reviewVerified":false,"resourceType":"question","prompt":"根据这段文字，选择说法正确的一项。\n棕色脂肪组织是一种功能特化为产热的组织，低温时动物通过激活棕色脂肪组织和促进白色脂肪棕色化的方式增加产热，以维持体温。团队科研人员利用不同的抗生素配方处理小鼠以清除小鼠的肠道菌群，发现缺失肠道菌群的小鼠体温调控机制受到破坏，研究发现肠道菌群的缺失减弱了棕色脂肪组织中UCP-1蛋白表达量的增加，降低了白色脂肪组织的棕色化水平。科研人员认为，产生这种作用的原因可能是在寒冷条件下，肠道菌群被破坏后，动物不能消化足够数量的食物，以满足寒冷条件下的热量需求。","options":[{"key":"A","text":"拥有肠道菌群的动物能够抵御寒冷"},{"key":"B","text":"小鼠的体温控制机制和人类类似"},{"key":"C","text":"动物只能依靠棕色脂肪组织维持体温"},{"key":"D","text":"UCP-1蛋白的表达量与肠道菌群的数量成正比"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"A 在本段低温调温语境下，肠道菌群参与食物利用和产热调节，四项中最符合文意。B 文段没有比较小鼠与人类。C “只能依靠”过于绝对。D 文段只说明菌群缺失会减弱UCP-1蛋白表达量的增加，没有给出菌群数量与蛋白表达量成正比的定量关系。","originalExampleFingerprint":"42e0997b","declaredOriginalSource":"2022联考","answerSourceKeys":["[\"verbal\",\"detail-judgement\",\"example\"]"],"semanticAdmission":{"questionBinding":{"questionId":"notes-q-app-ve01-000191","questionRevision":2,"effectiveContentDigest":"64953e9ede3d0b64814d98177095fa80c6c6de5a73ac26e7bc88d53e13ac0438"},"resolvedDependencyManifest":{"primaryTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-app-ve01-000191","revision":2,"sha256":"3c86260661746b22f3e1a98395532e1233fb9e39c0d6390616e345114abfde5b"}],"supportingTargets":[],"knowledgeAtoms":[],"comparisonGroups":[],"sourceBindings":[{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"detail-judgement","tabId":"example","revision":null,"sha256":"3d570c74707b05378e0784b11127cefc1d11a2936bfaa2b267106470f26354c2"},{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"detail-judgement","tabId":"knowledge","revision":null,"sha256":"3ff8341a65887a912c0307ede567765eb39ad120bc3d54b5d2bd867dfb77c28c"}],"sourceAnchors":[],"originalExample":{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"detail-judgement","tabId":"example","expectedBlockSha256":"fdf8e39922cfa60192f6ffc8c4ac9e9f4568bc3484760a2bfe10a9580a25dee8","revision":null},"materialGroup":null,"images":[],"sharedSourceBindings":[]},"dependencyDigest":"a2828fddef1e0d5027293ca318fca13f4ea5348e632caf94758480dc52ff94c3","ruleVersion":"exam-goal-v4","ruleDigest":"cde4b0cf5c8f1542a5a662cc642037c39b9968aba1618b319d56fd8b62cb8033","receiptId":"app-ve01-independent-notes-q-app-ve01-000191-r2","signatureVersion":"notes-semantic-v1","signature":"31534f565347feea1f74f51758a14d1c6ab23fe9913d64b50914f55843960b18"},"knowledgeAtoms":[],"resolvedTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-app-ve01-000191","revisio